      "string_id": "osvedomitel_about_slon_phrase_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Some stalker robbed a scientist and took a valuable artifact from him. I need to find the thief. His features: he is tall, wears a protective cloak and often repeats the phrase \"oh, for crying out loud\".",
      "JA_current": "あるストーカーが学者から貴重なアーティファクトを強奪して逃げたんだ。その泥棒を捜し出したい。特徴は、大柄で防護マントを羽織っていて、やたらと『ああ、もう！』とぼやく癖があるらしい。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "osvedomitel_about_slon",
